;\n  }\n  .link-tool::before {\n    content: \"⌕\"; left: 10px; top: 2px; font-size: 22px;\n    transform: rotate(-40deg);\n  }\n  .palette {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    height: 31px;\n    padding-left: 10px;\n    border-left: 1px solid #e1e1e1;\n  }\n  .dot {\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n  }\n  .black { background: #454545; }\n  .charcoal { background: #555; }\n  .red { background: #ef7772; }\n  .orange { background: #f2bb75; }\n  .yellow { background: #eee77a; box-shadow: 0 0 4px #d5d5d5; }\n  .blue { background: #b9dcef; }\n\n  .paper {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 62px;\n    bottom: 0;\n    padding: 9px 15px 20px 19px;\n    background-color: #fbfbf2;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(rgba(177,190,180,.25) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(177,190,180,.23) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 20px 20px;\n    color: #252621;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"FangSong\", \"SimSun\", cursive;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 22.8px;\n    letter-spacing: .15px;\n  }\n  .line {\n    height: 22.8px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .indent { padding-left: 5px; }\n  sub, sup {\n    font-size: 72%;\n    line-height: 0;\n  }\n  .hl-red, .hl-yellow {\n    position: relative;\n    display: inline;\n    padding: 0 1px;\n  }\n  .hl-red {\n    background: linear-gradient(transparent 50%, rgba(231,104,97,.42) 50%, rgba(231,104,97,.42) 91%, transparent 91%);\n  }\n  .hl-yellow {\n    background: linear-gradient(transparent 43%, rgba(239,222,55,.55) 43%, rgba(239,222,55,.55) 93%, transparent 93%);\n  }\n  .circled {\n    position: relative;\n    display: inline-block;\n    z-index: 0;\n  }\n  .circled::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: -1;\n    left: -5px;\n    right: -5px;\n    top: -2px;\n    bottom: -1px;\n    border: 1.8px solid rgba(210,63,61,.86);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    transform: rotate(-8deg);\n  }\n  .red-underline {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-decoration-color: rgba(218,65,61,.8);\n    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;\n    text-underline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"screen\">\n  <header class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"top-left\">\n      <span class=\"ui-icon back\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ui-icon grid-icon\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ui-icon search\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ui-icon share\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ui-icon mic\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ui-icon sound\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"title\">高中化学：90+逆袭计划</div>\n    <div class=\"top-right\">\n      <span class=\"ui-icon undo\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ui-icon redo\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ui-icon bookmark\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ui-icon page-icon\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ui-icon close\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ui-icon dots\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <nav class=\"tools\">\n    <span class=\"tool image-tool\"></span>\n    <span class=\"tool pen-tool\"></span>\n    <span class=\"tool eraser-tool\"></span>\n    <span class=\"tool marker-tool\"></span>\n    <span class=\"tool shapes-tool\"></span>\n    <span class=\"tool lasso-tool\"></span>\n    <span class=\"tool star-tool\"></span>\n    <span class=\"tool photo-tool\"></span>\n    <span class=\"tool text-tool\"></span>\n    <span class=\"tool link-tool\"></span>\n    <div class=\"palette\">\n      <span class=\"dot black\"></span>\n      <span class=\"dot charcoal\"></span>\n      <span class=\"dot red\"></span>\n      <span class=\"dot orange\"></span>\n      <span class=\"dot yellow\"></span>\n      <span class=\"dot blue\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main class=\"paper\">\n    <div class=\"line\">31、<span class=\"hl-red\">磷与氧气反应，氧气充足生成五氧化二磷，氧气<span class=\"circled\">不足</span>生成三氧化二磷。</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\">32、<span class=\"hl-red\">白磷的分子为P<sub>4</sub></span>、分子晶体，故12.4g白磷含有磷原子数目为0.4N<sub>A</sub>。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">33、Cl<sub>2</sub>与单质Fe反应，无论铁过量还是<span class=\"circled\">不过量</span>，<span class=\"hl-yellow\">反应成氯化铁，只有溶液中</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\">铁才与氯化铁反应生成氯化亚铁</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">34、<span class=\"hl-red\">Al<sup>3+</sup>＋3AlO<sub>2</sub><sup>−</sup>＋6H<sub>2</sub>O＝4Al(OH)<sub>3</sub>↓</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\">35、<span class=\"hl-yellow\">过量二氧化碳通入水玻璃中反应为：</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\">2H<sub>2</sub>O＋2CO<sub>2</sub>＋Na<sub>2</sub>SiO<sub>3</sub>＝2NaHCO<sub>3</sub>＋H<sub>2</sub>SiO<sub>3</sub>↓ 二氧化碳<span class=\"circled\">不过量</span>生成碳酸钠</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">36、说说半径大小：</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent\">（1）同族相同，核大半径小</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent\">（2）层数，层大半径大</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent\">（3）核同，价高半径小，例如铁大于二价铁<span class=\"circled\">大于</span>三价铁</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent\">（4）电子层结构相同，核电荷数越大，半径越小。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">37、C是形成化合物最多的元素，单质是自然界中硬度<span class=\"circled\">最大</span>的物质元素或气态</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">氢化物中氢同质量分数最高的元素。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">38、元素气态氢化物和它的最高价氧化物在常温下反应生成该元素<span class=\"circled\">单质</span>的是S。这</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">是高中很重要的<span class=\"circled\">氧化还原反应</span>，也是<span class=\"circled\">唯一</span>体现二氧化硫具有氧化性的反应。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">2H<sub>2</sub>S＋SO<sub>2</sub>＝2H<sub>2</sub>O＋3S</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">39、<span class=\"hl-yellow\">元素间气态氢化物和它的最高价氧化物对应的水化物能反应生成盐的元</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"hl-yellow\">素为N。</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\">40、单质在常温下呈液态的非金属元素为Br.</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"hl-yellow\">单质在常温下呈液态的金属元素为：Hg.</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\">41、合金是混合物，<span class=\"hl-red\">性能往往优于其成分的金属</span>，比如：硬度比它的各组分</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">金属硬度大，合金熔点比它的各组分熔点低。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">42、<span class=\"red-underline\">3Mg＋N<sub>2</sub>＝＝Mg<sub>3</sub>N<sub>2</sub></span>　<span class=\"red-underline\">2Mg＋CO<sub>2</sub>＝＝C＋2MgO</span>（条件都是点燃，别忘记</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">哦，化物质前面<span class=\"circled\">也</span>会出，如果认为镁与氮气<span class=\"red-underline\">不反应</span>就是错的哦）</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">43、生铁、普通钢、不锈钢含碳量依次降低，生铁是含碳量大于2%的</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">铁碳合金，钢：钢是含碳量在0.04%－2.3%之间的铁碳合金，不锈钢是Fe、</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">C、Cr合金，Fe含量大约为74.6%。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">44、明矾净水的原理是利用水解原理，原理是明矾在水中可以电离出两种金</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">属离子：KAl(SO<sub>4</sub>)<sub>2</sub>＝K<sup>＋</sup>＋Al<sup>3＋</sup>＋2SO<sub>4</sub><sup>2−</sup> 而Al<sup>3＋</sup>很容易水解，生成胶</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">体氢氧化铝Al(OH)<sub>3</sub>：Al<sup>3＋</sup>＋3H<sub>2</sub>O＝Al(OH)<sub>3</sub>（胶体）＋3H<sup>＋</sup> 氢氧化铝</div>\n  </main>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
